# Read by Nx for the API's `catalog-import` target, after this project's other
# files and before `.env` at the repository root. It holds no secret: it names
# the development database user's password, which `pnpm services:up` keeps in
# that `.env` file, under the name the API reads. A value set in the shell wins.
DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=${PCP_DB_PASSWORD}
